WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:12.470
The world entered a new Dark Age. I was one of the last synthetics to survive.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:23.239
You sure this is the place? Yeah, she's here.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.080
Wake up.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.000
Who are you?

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:34.180
I've been looking for you for a long time.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.040
Show me death.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.800
Her name's Ash. She's the perfect woman right? Encryptable.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.300
God I love that.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.820
I think I want me a robot.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.260
Why did you save me?  Maybe I'm malfunctioning?

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:10.190
I've never had this feeling before.

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:16.220
It was at that moment I became aware of exactly how different I was.

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:18.220
I had to set things right.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.140
You took away the one thing that was mine.

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:33.680
Two guns, ten bullets we're gonna need everyone. You say like that's a bad thing or something man.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.620
Welcome to paradise.

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:04.280
This isn't paradise.

